# Reverse Proxy Workflow

1. Understand the role of a reverse proxy
2. Identify use cases for a reverse proxy (e.g. load balancing, hiding internal IPs)
3. Implement HTTPS termination with a reverse proxy (e.g., nginx, Caddy, ALB)
4. Configure your application to communicate with the backend through the reverse proxy
